<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Ellerine adds a sparkle to H1 shr, div.</title>
<headline>Ellerine adds a sparkle to H1 shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended February 28, 1997 vs six months to February 1996.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     93.0	  vs 78.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 31.0	  vs 25.8</p>
<p>    Retained income	 45.90	 vs 38.13</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   109.11	vs 92.74</p>
<p>    Tax			 40.26	 vs 35.43</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	68.85	 vs 57.31</p>
<p>    Turnover		  658.37	vs 585.62</p>
<p>Div payable around May 16</p>
<p>on register May 2</p>
<p>Full name: Ellerine Holdings Limited</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said with the delivery of housing under the reconstruction and development programme starting to take place and the ongoing electrification programme, the shift towards television, audio equipment and household appliances was continuing. It said this created increased opportunities for future growth to which the group was responding.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
